   },
   "confidence": "medium",
   "notes": "Exact form 4C_N + B(F,1/(NT)) * sum ... also given; only O form recorded. Regret defined via means (pseudo-regret). Algorithm may require functional optimization in nonparametric classes; compute not stated."
